  m_Name: HierophantReverseCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  Name: The Hierophant Reversed
  text: "The card looms in your hand, dark and oppressive, a symbol of corrupted
    authority.  $Its weight crushes rather than guides, and rules twist into chains. 
    $You feel the Hand of the King here\u2014stern no longer, but violent, intolerant,
    and merciless to those who disobey.  $Every glance threatens punishment; every
    command is enforced with iron and fear.  $The Hierophant Reversed reminds you
    that order can become oppression, and that defiance may awaken the harshest wrath
    of power."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7db6682c29bd8282ca46a093ca4416da, type: 3}
